---
interface Props { lang?: 'de' | 'en'; }
const { lang = 'de' } = Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === 'en';
---
<section class="section problem" id="problem">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">{isEn ? 'The problem' : 'Das Problem'}</span>
      <h2>{isEn ? 'Your data is already out there.' : 'Deine Daten sind schon draußen.'}</h2>
      <p>
        {isEn ? 'Every day, people paste names, IBANs, contracts, and medical reports into AI tools. The providers see everything.' : 'Jeden Tag kopieren Menschen Namen, IBANs, Verträge und Arztbefunde in KI-Tools. Die Anbieter sehen alles.'}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card card-glow animate-slide-up animate-delay-1">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H8a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>{isEn ? '"Summarize this contract"' : '"Fasse diesen Vertrag zusammen"'}</h3>
        <p class="problem-desc">
          {isEn ? 'A sales rep pastes a full customer contract into ChatGPT — names, IBANs, amounts included. All of it now sits on OpenAI servers.' : 'Ein Vertriebsmitarbeiter kopiert einen Kundenvertrag in ChatGPT — mit Namen, IBANs, Beträgen. All das liegt jetzt auf OpenAI-Servern.'}
        </p>
        <div class="problem-stat">
          <span class="problem-stat-number">82%</span>
          <span class="problem-stat-label">{isEn ? 'of companies report employees entering sensitive data into AI tools' : 'der Unternehmen geben an, dass Mitarbeitende sensible Daten in KI-Tools eingeben'}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-glow animate-slide-up animate-delay-2">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>{isEn ? '"Translate this medical report"' : '"Übersetze diesen Befund"'}</h3>
        <p class="problem-desc">
          {isEn ? 'A doctor has a patient report translated by AI. Patient name, social security number, diagnosis — stored by the provider for up to 30 days.' : 'Eine Ärztin lässt einen Befund von der KI übersetzen. Patientenname, Sozialversicherungsnummer, Diagnose — der Anbieter speichert alles, teils bis zu 30 Tage.'}
        </p>
        <div class="problem-stat">
          <span class="problem-stat-number">Art. 9</span>
          <span class="problem-stat-label">{isEn ? 'GDPR: Health data requires special protection — violations can cost up to EUR 20M' : 'DSGVO: Gesundheitsdaten erfordern besonderen Schutz — Verstöße können bis zu 20 Mio. EUR kosten'}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-glow animate-slide-up animate-delay-3">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/>
            <path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v16"/>
            <line x1="6" y1="11" x2="10" y2="11"/>
            <line x1="14" y1="11" x2="18" y2="11"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>{isEn ? '"Help me with my tax return"' : '"Hilf mir bei der Steuererklärung"'}</h3>
        <p class="problem-desc">
          {isEn ? 'A freelancer pastes income details, tax ID, and address into the chat. Google, OpenAI, or Anthropic now have that data.' : 'Ein Freiberufler kopiert Einkommensdaten, Steuernummer und Adresse in den Chat. Google, OpenAI oder Anthropic haben diese Daten jetzt.'}
        </p>
        <div class="problem-stat">
          <span class="problem-stat-number">{isEn ? 'GDPR' : 'DSGVO'}</span>
          <span class="problem-stat-label">{isEn ? 'Violations can cost up to EUR 20M or 4% of annual revenue' : 'Verstöße können bis zu 20 Mio. EUR oder 4% des Jahresumsatzes kosten'}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem {
    position: relative;
  }

  .problem::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--color-border), transparent);
  }

  .problem-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .problem-stat {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .problem-stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .problem-stat-label {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>